# Line endings.
#
# Normalise to LF in the repository; let each platform check out what it wants.
# Without this, a Windows working copy with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every file
# it touches, and every diff shows line-ending noise instead of content. The
# repository's own rule (core/CORE_SPEC.md §5) is that state files are plain text
# and their diffs must be readable - a diff that is 100% carriage returns is not.
* text=auto

*.md     text
*.json   text
*.py     text
*.txt    text
*.yml    text
*.yaml   text

*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.pdf    binary
